DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnnaattttrr__ggeettppggrroouupp() function obtains the value of the spawn-
     pgroup attribute from the attributes object referenced by _a_t_t_r.

     The ppoossiixx__ssppaawwnnaattttrr__sseettppggrroouupp() function sets the spawn-pgroup attribute
     in an initialized attributes object referenced by _a_t_t_r.

     The spawn-pgroup attribute represents the process group to be joined by
     the new process image in a spawn operation (if POSIX_SPAWN_SETPGROUP is
     set in the spawn-flags attribute).  The default value of this attribute
     is zero.

